PE 793: Median of Products / 乘积中位数

=== Products a*b (a≤b) for small N ===
  N=2: M= 3 median=   2 (fast=2)  products: 1 2 4
  N=3: M= 6 median=   3 (fast=3)  products: 1 2 3 4 6 9
  N=4: M=10 median=   4 (fast=4)  products: 1 2 3 4 4 6 8 9 12 16
  N=5: M=15 median=   8 (fast=8)  products: 1 2 3 4 4 5 6 8 9 10 12 15 16 20 25
  N=6: M=21 median=  10 (fast=10)  products: 1 2 3 4 4 5 6 6 8 9 10 12 12 15 16 18 20 24 25 30 36
  N=7: M=28 median=  12 (fast=12)  products: 1 2 3 4 4 5 6 6 7 8 9 10 12 12 14 15 16 18 20 21 24 25 28 30 35 36 42 49
  N=8: M=36 median=  16 (fast=16)  products: 1 2 3 4 4 5 6 6 7 8 8 9 10 12 12 14 15 16 16 18 20 21 24 24 25 28 30 32 35 36 40 42 48 49 56 64

=== Median via binary search (larger N) ===
  N=10: M=  55 median=      24
  N=20: M= 210 median=      84
  N=30: M= 465 median=     182
  N=40: M= 820 median=     320
  N=50: M=1275 median=     494

